## 📄 Fayl: `admin\src\styles.css`

```css
@tailwind base;
@tailwind components;
@tailwind utilities;

:root {
  --background: #f0f2f8;
  --secondary-bg: #e8ecf4;
  --surface: #ffffff;
  --surface-elevated: #fcfcfd;
  --foreground: #111827;
  --border: #e2e8f0;
  --divider: #edf1f7;
  --text-primary: #111827;
  --text-secondary: #4b5563;
  --text-muted: #6b7280;
}

.dark {
  --background: #090a0f;
  --secondary-bg: #15161f;
  --surface: #12131a;
  --surface-elevated: #1a1b24;
  --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  --divider: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  --text-primary: #f8fafc;
  --text-secondary: #cbd5e1;
  --text-muted: #94a3b8;
}

@layer base {
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  html, body, #root {
    height: 100%;
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', 'Inter', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  body {
    background-color: var(--background);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; height: 6px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--border); border-radius: 3px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: var(--text-muted); }
}

@layer utilities {
  .gradient-primary { background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f6bff 0%, #7b5cff 100%); }
  .text-gradient { 
    background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f6bff 0%, #7b5cff 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }
  .glass {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
  }
  .dark .glass {
    background: rgba(18, 19, 26, 0.8);
  }
}

@keyframes fade-in {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}
@keyframes slide-in {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(16px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
}
@keyframes pulse-soft {
  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
  50% { opacity: 0.6; }
}

.animate-fade-in { animation: fade-in 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); }
.animate-slide-in { animation: slide-in 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); }
.animate-pulse-soft { animation: pulse-soft 2s ease-in-out infinite; }

```

